      `the kind of casino transaction` IS A `reg 27(6) kind of transaction` @desc What kind of transaction is it: a wager, a purchase of tokens, a payment for a gaming machine, a deposit for remote gambling, a collection of winnings, or another?
      `the transaction consists of the conclusion of an agreement for the letting of land` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this so: the transaction consists of the conclusion of an agreement for the letting of land? (true or false)
