DECIDE `Under regulation 27, am I required to apply customer due diligence measures on this occasion` IS
    `reg 8(2) one of the limbs of the list holds` (LIST (`reg 27(1)(a) the relevant person establishes a business relationship` (`mlr1 what I say, as a fact` `regulation 4(1) to (3) there is a business relationship`) `the relevant person establishes that business relationship`), (`reg 27(1)(b) the relevant person carries out an occasional transaction that is a transfer of funds exceeding 800 pounds` (Transaction OF `the value of the transaction, linked operations taken together, in pounds sterling`, `the transaction is paid in cash`, `the transaction is carried out as part of a business relationship`, `the transaction is a transfer of funds under the funds transfer regulation`)), (`reg 27(1)(c) the relevant person suspects money laundering or terrorist financing` `I suspect money laundering or terrorist financing`), (`reg 27(1)(d) the relevant person doubts the veracity or adequacy of documents or information previously obtained` `I doubt the veracity or adequacy of documents or information previously obtained for the purposes of identification or verification`), (`reg 27(2) the relevant person carries out an occasional transaction of 12000 pounds or more` (LIST `the kind of business I carry on`) (Transaction OF `the value of the transaction, linked operations taken together, in pounds sterling`, `the transaction is paid in cash`, `the transaction is carried out as part of a business relationship`, `the transaction is a transfer of funds under the funds transfer regulation`)), (`reg 27(3) the high value dealer carries out an occasional transaction in cash of 10000 pounds or more` (LIST `the kind of business I carry on`) (Transaction OF `the value of the transaction, linked operations taken together, in pounds sterling`, `the transaction is paid in cash`, `the transaction is carried out as part of a business relationship`, `the transaction is a transfer of funds under the funds transfer regulation`) (`reg 27(4) the transaction is a transaction in cash for the purpose