nsaction is a trade in a work of art, carried out or acted in respect of by the firm or sole practitioner`), (`reg 27(7C)(b) the art market participant is the operator of a freeport storing works of art of 10000 pounds or more` (LIST `the kind of business I carry on`) `the art market participant is the operator of a freeport` `the value of the works of art so stored for a person, or series of linked persons, in pounds sterling`), (`reg 27(7D) the cryptoasset exchange provider carries out a transaction using its machine` (LIST `the kind of business I carry on`) `the person operates a machine which utilises automated processes to exchange cryptoassets for money, or money for cryptoassets` `the transaction is carried out using that machine`), (`reg 27(7E) the cryptoasset exchange provider or custodian wallet provider carries out a cryptoasset transfer of 800 pounds or more` (LIST `the kind of business I carry on`) (`Cryptoasset transfer` OF `the kind of cryptoasset transfer`, `the value of the cryptoasset transfer, linked transfers taken together, in pounds sterling`)), (`reg 27(8)(za) the relevant person has a legal duty to contact an existing customer to review beneficial ownership information` `the relevant person has a legal duty in the course of the calendar year to contact an existing customer for the purpose of reviewing information that is relevant to the risk assessment for that customer and relates to the beneficial ownership of the customer`), (`reg 27(8)(zb) the relevant person has to contact an existing customer to fulfil a duty under the International Tax Compliance Regulations 2015` `the relevant person has to contact an existing customer in order to fulfil a duty under the International Tax Compliance Regulations 2015`), (`reg 27(8)(a) it is an appropriate time to apply customer due diligence measures to existing customers` `it is appropriate, on a risk based approach, to apply customer due diligence measures to existing customers at this time`), (`reg 