    `reg 55(2) the person is an Annex 1 financial institution` (`reg 53 what I say, as a fact` `reg 10(2)(a) the person falls within regulation 10(2)(a)`) `the person is a financial institution` `the person is a money service business` `the person is an authorised person` `the person is a bill payment service provider` `the person is a telecommunication, digital and IT payment service provider`

