§§ `Telling my customer where they are not protected (regs 60A and 60B)`
-- Situation: asked of a cryptoasset exchange provider or custodian wallet provider dealing with customers, or about a change of control
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- reg 60A(1).  Whether there is a business relationship is regulation 4's answer (seam S-K1); you say Yes, No or not sure.
@export Under regulation 60A(1), does the duty to inform my customer apply to this relationship or transaction?
GIVEN `the person is a cryptoasset exchange provider or custodian wallet provider` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is a cryptoasset exchange provider or custodian wallet provider?
      `reg 4(1) to (3) there is a business relationship` IS A `reg 53 my answer` @desc Yes, No or not sure: reg 4(1) to (3) there is a business relationship?
      `it enters into a transaction with a customer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that it enters into a transaction with a customer?
      `it arises out of any of its activities as a cryptoasset business` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that it arises out of any of its activities as a cryptoasset business?
      `the activity is within the scope of the jurisdiction of the Financial Ombudsman Service` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the activity is within the scope of the jurisdiction of the Financial Ombudsman Service?
      `the activity is subject to protection under the Financial Services Compensation Scheme` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the activity is subject to protection under the Financial Services Compensation Scheme?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under regulation 60A(1), does the duty to inform my customer apply to this relationship or transaction` IS
    `reg 60A(1) paragraph (2) applies` `the person is a cryptoasset exchange provider or custodian wallet provider` (`reg 53 what I say, as a fact` `reg 4(1) to (3) there is a business relationship`) `it enters into a transaction with a customer` `it arises out of any of its activities as a cryptoasset business` `the activity is within the scope of the jurisdiction of the Financial Ombudsman Service` `the activity is subject to protection under the Financial Services Compensation Scheme`

-- reg 60A(2).  Whether paragraph (1) applies is the answer to the question on regulation 60A(1); you say Yes, No or not sure.
@export Under regulation 60A(2), have I informed my customer, before establishing the business relationship or entering into the transaction, of the position on the Financial Ombudsman Service and the Financial Services Compensation Scheme?
GIVEN `paragraph (2) applies` IS A `reg 53 my answer` @desc Yes, No or not sure: paragraph (2) applies?
      `the cryptoasset business informed the customer of the position before establishing the business relationship or entering into the transaction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the cryptoasset business informed the customer of the position before establishing the business relationship or entering into the transaction?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under regulation 60A(2), have I informed my customer, before establishing the business relationship or entering into the transaction, of the position on the Financial Ombudsman Service and the Financial Services Compensation Scheme` IS
    `reg 60A(2) the cryptoasset business has informed the customer before establishing the business relationship or entering into the transaction` (`reg 53 what I say, as a fact` `paragraph (2) applies`) `the cryptoasset business informed the customer of the position before establishing the business relationship or entering into the transaction`

-- reg 60B.
@export Under regulation 60B, does Schedule 6B apply to this acquisition of, or increase in control over, my registered cryptoasset business?
GIVEN `it is an acquisition of or increase in control over a registered cryptoasset business within the meaning given at regulation 59(8)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that it is an acquisition of or increase in control over a registered cryptoasset business within the meaning given at regulation 59(8)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under regulation 60B, does Schedule 6B apply to this acquisition of, or increase in control over, my registered cryptoasset business` IS
    `reg 60B Schedule 6B applies to the acquisition or increase in control` `it is an acquisition of or increase in control over a registered cryptoasset business within the meaning given at regulation 59(8)`

