      `the person is acting on behalf of the Scottish Ministers in their capacity as an enforcement authority under that Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is acting on behalf of the Scottish Ministers in their capacity as an enforcement authority under that Act?
      `the person is a constable or an equivalent officer of any law enforcement authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person is a constable or an equivalent officer of any law enforcement authority?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under regulation 64(3), is this person one whose enquiries I must be able to answer fully and rapidly` IS
    `reg 64(3) the person is a person specified in this paragraph` `the person is a financial investigator accredited under section 3 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002` `the person is acting on behalf of the Scottish Ministers in their capacity as an enforcement authority under that Act` `the person is a constable or an equivalent officer of any law enforcement authority`

-- reg 64(2).  Whether the enquirer is specified in paragraph (3) is the answer to the question on regulation 64(3); you say Yes, No or not sure.
@export Under regulation 64(2), am I able to respond fully and rapidly to this enquiry from a person specified in regulation 64(3)?
