      `the enquiry concerns information required by or under the funds transfer regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the enquiry concerns information required by or under the funds transfer regulation?
      `the payment service provider is able to respond fully and rapidly` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the payment service provider is able to respond fully and rapidly?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under regulation 64(2), am I able to respond fully and rapidly to this enquiry from a person specified in regulation 64(3)` IS
    `reg 64(2) the payment service provider is able to respond fully and rapidly to the enquiry` (`reg 53 what I say, as a fact` `the person making the enquiry is a person specified in paragraph (3)`) `the enquiry concerns information required by or under the funds transfer regulation` `the payment service provider is able to respond fully and rapidly`

