      `the guidance is guidance the authority must consider` IS A `reg 65-110 My answer` @desc Is the guidance guidance that regulation 76(6)(b) requires the authority to consider? (Yes, No or I am not sure)
      `the authority considered whether at the time P followed the guidance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the authority considered whether at the time P followed the guidance?
