      `the estate agent is unable to apply the customer due diligence measures required by regulation 28` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it because you were unable to apply the customer due diligence measures regulation 28 requires?
      `regulations 33 and 35 to 37 are relevant in relation to the offeror` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are customer due diligence measures under regulations 33 and 35 to 37 relevant in relation to the offeror?
      `the estate agent is unable to apply the customer due diligence measures required by regulations 33 and 35 to 37 in relation to the offeror` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you unable to apply those measures?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under schedule 7 paragraph 12, does paragraph 2 of Schedule 3 to the Estate Agents Order 1991 apply to me when I could not complete customer due diligence` IS
    `sch 7 para 12 paragraph 2 of Schedule 3 to the Estate Agents (Undesirable Practices) (No 2) Order 1991 applies` WITH `the estate agent does not forward accurate details of the offer` IS `the estate agent does not forward accurate details of the offer`, `the estate agent is unable to apply the customer due diligence measures required by regulation 28` IS `the estate agent is unable to apply the customer due diligence measures required by regulation 28`, `regulations 33 and 35 to 37 are relevant in relation to the offeror` IS `regulations 33 and 35 to 37 are relevant in relation to the offeror`, `the estate agent is unable to apply the customer due diligence measures required by regulations 33 and 35 to 37 in relation to the offeror` IS `the estate agent is unable to apply the customer due diligence measures required by regulations 33 and 35 to 37 in relation to the offeror`

